<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Report an Issue | ZimPlug Music</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#050505;color:#fff;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:85px 24px}
.eyebrow{color:#d4af37;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px}
h1{font-size:clamp(45px,7vw,72px);line-height:1;margin:18px 0}
.intro{max-width:700px;color:#999;line-height:1.8;font-size:16px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:50px}
.card{background:#0b0b0b;border:1px solid #202020;border-radius:16px;padding:28px}
.card h2{margin-top:0;font-size:21px}
.card p,.card li{color:#999;line-height:1.75;font-size:14px}
section{border-top:1px solid #202020;padding:40px 0;margin-top:45px}
@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding:60px 20px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>

<span class="eyebrow">ZIMPLUG MUSIC</span>
<h1>Report an <span style="color:#d4af37">Issue</span></h1>

<p class="intro">
Help us keep ZimPlug Music safe, accurate and reliable. Use this
page to report copyright concerns, broken downloads, inappropriate
content, security problems or incorrect information.
</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<h2>Copyright infringement</h2>
<p>
If you own copyrighted material and believe it is being distributed
on ZimPlug Music without authorization, provide enough information
for us to identify the material and review your complaint.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Broken download</h2>
<p>
Tell us the song title, artist name and what happens when you try
to download it. Include the page address if available.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Incorrect information</h2>
<p>
Report incorrect artist names, song titles, genres, artwork,
release information or other metadata.
</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
<h2>Security issue</h2>
<p>
If you discover a security vulnerability or suspicious behaviour,
please report it responsibly rather than attempting to access,
change or damage another person's account or data.
</p>
</div>

</div>

<section>
<h2>What to include</h2>
<ul>
<li>Your name and contact information.</li>
<li>The URL of the affected page.</li>
<li>The song, artist or content involved.</li>
<li>A clear description of the problem.</li>
<li>Any supporting information that helps us investigate.</li>
</ul>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Copyright reports</h2>
<p>
Copyright complaints should include a description of the copyrighted
work, identification of the material being complained about, your
contact information, and a statement explaining your rights or
authorization to make the complaint.
</p>
</section>

<section>
<h2>Submit a report</h2>
<p>
Please use the official ZimPlug Music contact channel available on
the website. Do not include passwords, authentication codes or
unnecessary sensitive personal information in a report.
</p>
</section>

</main>
</body>
</html>